#: ../../../user/templates/debian/debian-upgrade.rst:5
#: 9a7633334b4349beab79a91d72fe1103
msgid "How to upgrade a Debian template in-place"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/templates/debian/debian-upgrade.rst:8
#: 894660eeb7684dc2880f4ed011e86d60
msgid "This page is intended for advanced users."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/templates/debian/debian-upgrade.rst:10
#: 0a36d4d6c867487ca308115eeb230571
msgid ""
"Most users will find it easier to :ref:`install a new template <user/"
"templates/debian/debian:installing>` instead of upgrading in-place. If you "
"have made customizations or installed additional packages in the current "
"template that you want to preserve, then upgrading in-place may be the best "
"way to go."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/templates/debian/debian-upgrade.rst:14
#: eaafedb48bec435594c8b4dec13e3845
msgid ""
"This page provides instructions for performing an in-place upgrade of an "
"installed :doc:`Debian Template </user/templates/debian/debian>`. In "
"general, upgrading a Debian template follows the same process as `upgrading "
"a native Debian system <https://wiki.debian.org/DebianUpgrade>`__."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/templates/debian/debian-upgrade.rst:17
#: 200b19252ece485bafdc070b77f2f43e
msgid ""
"In what follows the prompt on each line indicates where each command should "
"be entered: ``dom0``, ``debian-<old>``, or ``debian-<new>``, where ``<old>`` "
"is the Debian version number *from* which you are upgrading, and ``<new>`` "
"is the Debian version number *to* which you are upgrading. Remember to use "
"the right template *version*: eg clone ``debian-<old>-minimal`` to ``debian-"
"<new>-minimal``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/templates/debian/debian-upgrade.rst:19
#: 24631fa015f349479d35897c8b42eb27
msgid ""
"By default, Qubes uses code `names` in the apt sources files (bookworm, "
"trixie, etc), although the templates are referred to by release number. "
"Check the code names for the templates, and ensure you are aware of any "
"changes you have made in the repository definitions."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/templates/debian/debian-upgrade.rst:22
#: 0a7298cc0d604ea7819af90f648ba620
msgid "Summary instructions for Debian templates"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/templates/debian/debian-upgrade.rst:40
#: 505f35f3ec604bec835b780af038e3ef
msgid "Detailed instructions for Debian templates"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/templates/debian/debian-upgrade.rst:43
#: aba93997dbfa4e1794d55a4a705340b6
msgid ""
"These instructions will show you how to upgrade Debian templates. The same "
"general procedure may be used to upgrade any template based on the standard "
"Debian templates."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/templates/debian/debian-upgrade.rst:45
#: 0d0551ca16114bbda344f23c2d97a1aa
msgid "Ensure the existing template is not running."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/templates/debian/debian-upgrade.rst:52
#: 8a14a727bc714e3e991a09e8d0da8dc0
msgid "Clone the existing template and start a terminal in the new template."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/templates/debian/debian-upgrade.rst:59
#: f22a779e926e4278968876cedec3ff57
msgid "Update the new cloned template."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/templates/debian/debian-upgrade.rst:66
#: a4306bc79e6f46aba6822246dd8e2f7b
msgid ""
"Update your ``apt`` repositories to use the new release’s code name instead "
"of the old release’s code name. (This can be done manually with a text "
"editor, but ``sed`` can be used to automatically update the files.)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/templates/debian/debian-upgrade.rst:75
#: 4d563d397e9841cca6dc583b59334f25
msgid ""
"Update the package lists and upgrade. During the process, it may prompt you "
"to overwrite the file ``qubes-r4.list``. You should overwrite this file."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/templates/debian/debian-upgrade.rst:85
#: 36568c42b7c5433282d2f2b27e67389b
msgid "(Optional) Remove unnecessary packages that were previously installed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/templates/debian/debian-upgrade.rst:93
#: 224c2c15a5a7401ea005810a3b945b7e
msgid "(Optional) Clean cached packages from ``/var/cache/apt``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/templates/debian/debian-upgrade.rst:101
#: 3ac9e0bfdc6449f0a0548b418f2726cb
msgid ""
"(Optional) Trim the new template. (This should :ref:`no longer be necessary "
"<user/templates/templates:important notes>`, but it does not hurt. Some "
"users have `reported <https://github.com/QubesOS/qubes-issues/issues/"
"5055>`__ that it makes a difference.)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/templates/debian/debian-upgrade.rst:111
#: c419eae7b8b343f8b7ca54c8f5de5a1b
msgid "Shut down the new template."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/templates/debian/debian-upgrade.rst:118
#: ab29e77b41b74dc68c442caa30fe8115
msgid "Set the template-name, which is used by the Qubes updater."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/templates/debian/debian-upgrade.rst:125
#: c53c3f793a5d43a8a647f646eae5fa03
msgid ""
"(Recommended) :ref:`Switch everything that was set to the old template to "
"the new template. <user/templates/templates:switching>`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/templates/debian/debian-upgrade.rst:129
#: a190666432824af69910ee4419e14c4f
msgid "(Optional) Make the new template the global default."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/templates/debian/debian-upgrade.rst:136
#: bbb93963cbed4530beed6661a21d0bf3
msgid ""
"(Optional) :ref:`Uninstall the old template. <user/templates/"
"templates:uninstalling>` Make sure that the template you’re uninstalling is "
"the old one, not the new one!"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/templates/debian/debian-upgrade.rst:139
#: 12ea9c055408468aaf12017e1f7aca4e
msgid ""
"If you installed packages from one of the :doc:`testing </user/downloading-"
"installing-upgrading/testing>` repositories, you **must** make sure that the "
"repository is enabled in ``/etc/apt/sources.list.d/qubes-r4.list`` "
"**before** attempting the upgrade. Otherwise, your upgrade will `break "
"<https://github.com/QubesOS/qubes-issues/issues/2418>`__."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/templates/debian/debian-upgrade.rst:143
#: c5a7027ffe0640229fe2f15f7156799d
msgid "Standalones"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/templates/debian/debian-upgrade.rst:146
#: 670cc8ab36c1472d8420b4493bcd8d54
msgid ""
"The procedure for upgrading a Debian :doc:`standalone </user/advanced-topics/"
"standalones-and-hvms>` is the same as for a template."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/templates/debian/debian-upgrade.rst:154
#: 47afb8137529411696afcd0845a9721d
msgid "End-of-life (EOL) releases"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/templates/debian/debian-upgrade.rst:157
#: 7c4cfb02a06e41bf9a2a830c7907ca19
msgid ""
"We strongly recommend against using any Debian release that has reached `end-"
"of-life (EOL) <https://wiki.debian.org/"
"DebianReleases#Production_Releases>`__."
msgstr ""
